./docs/cache-break-investigation-2026-05-16.md:177:3. **`defer_loading` flipping for the same tool.** Line 1263 only emits `defer_loading: true` when **all three** of `supportsDeferredTools && tool.deferLoading && !tool.alwaysLoad` hold. `supportsDeferredTools` is per-model (stable per session). `tool.deferLoading` is the static field on the tool. `tool.alwaysLoad` is also static. So this should be stable per (model, tool). However, if the bridge's reported model swaps between turns (e.g. fallback model on a retry) or if `alwaysLoad` is set late (after tool activation), this flips and the tool's hash differs.
